<title>FRANCE: Paribas Cap Mkts downgrades Club Med.</title>
<headline>Paribas Cap Mkts downgrades Club Med.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paribas Capital Markets said on Wednesday it downgraded French leisure group Club Mediterranee to sell from neutral on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Two days ago, Paribas Capital Markets downgraded the stock to neutral from buy.</p>
<p>Paribas said the rise in the share after the appointment of Philippe Bourguignon to head Club Med was too precipitous.</p>
<p>Club Med fell 5.21 percent to 427.50 francs on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
</text>
